<exercise>
  <problem>
    <para>What did you discover when you compared your answers? Explain your rationale.</para>
    </problem><solution>
    
    <para>Enter your answer here:</para>
  <para>Compare your answer:</para>
    <para>Your answer may vary, but here is a sample. 
      Even though our questions were different, the answers were the same because the expressions were equivalent.
    </para>
